WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Raw Drive Rush approaches after the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.525
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu as he rises.

3
00:00:01.525 --> 00:00:02.400
Crouching heavy punch links after the Rush heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.300
One Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.525
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:06.300
Heavy Flash Knuckle completes the conversion.
